# This directory holds Pi-agent runtime content only: agents/, skills/,
# extensions/, bin/, and the installable server source. Entries below are
# either local build state or configuration owned by a different AI harness.
# Ignoring them lets another tool drop its config here without turning it
# into a managed artifact that install.sh would copy into every project.
#
# This file is tracked on purpose: the exclusions are a shared convention,
# so a fresh clone must inherit them. It is not part of the installer's
# managed file set, so it never reaches a business project.

# Safety net only: this directory is not an npm project. Extensions resolve
# their dependencies through Pi's own installation. If these files appear,
# tests/test_runtime_content_ownership.py::TeamflowDirectoryIsNotNpmProjectTests fails.
node_modules
package.json
package-lock.json
bun.lock

# Other AI harness configuration and interface metadata (no consumer here)
openai.yaml
openai.yml
.codex/
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
.cursor/
.windsurf/
